The important distinction:

Craneware serving 2,000+ hospitals does not mean 2,000 hospitals were breached.

What it does mean is the potential concentration risk is unusually high, because a single vendor relationship can sit within thousands of healthcare organizations. Craneware's customer footprint spans more than 2,000 hospitals and health systems and close to 10,000 clinics and pharmacies.

